text = "amy canon's specials give     \nher great defence and         \nmobility,and even uncharged   \nshe stays dangerous.her       \nattacks can't be parried,and \nshe's pretty fast by herself, \nbut she also has the /hammer  \njump~ which lets her access   \nshortcuts and hit enemies on \njump's start,plus a /hammer  \nrush~ that charges through exe\nfaster than her own run,     \nstunning everything it       \ntouches.she's been walking   \nout of prisons since the     \nstarfall islands. it's not   \nfanon, it's №canon~";
